---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { AUTHOR } from '../data/author';
---

<Layout title="About — Neo Mind Flow" description="Who we are, how we pick the books we recommend, and how this site is funded.">
  <main class="container about">
    <h1 class="about-title">About Neo Mind Flow</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      Neo Mind Flow is an independent editorial publication covering self-improvement,
      personal growth, and the books that actually move the needle.
    </p>

    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <p>
      We research, compare, and summarize the most recommended self-help and personal
      development books, so you can spend less time browsing and more time applying
      what works. Every article is built around a simple promise: after reading, you
      should know exactly which book to pick and why.
    </p>

    <h2>Who's behind it</h2>
    <p>
      The Site is produced by the {AUTHOR.name}, with editorial oversight and a
      consistent review process. We use AI-assisted tools to research and draft
      content, and every piece is then reviewed against our selection criteria below
      before it is published. When an article says a book "earns its reputation,"
      that judgment is based on the criteria below — not on commissions.
    </p>

    <h2>How we pick the books we recommend</h2>
    <p>Every book we feature clears three bars:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Actionable</strong> — it gives you something concrete to do, not just concepts.</li>
      <li><strong>Enduring</strong> — it is still widely recommended years after publication.</li>
      <li><strong>Specific</strong> — it is written for a particular reader and problem, not everyone.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We also look at a book's honest weaknesses — what it gets wrong, where it has
      aged, and who it is <em>not</em> for. A list where every book is perfect is not
      a recommendation; it's an ad.
    </p>

    <h2>How this site is funded</h2>
    <p>
      Neo Mind Flow is reader-supported. When you buy a book through a link on this
      Site, we may earn a commission from retailers such as Amazon, at no extra cost
      to you. This does not affect our selections: books are chosen against the
      criteria above, and the affiliate relationship is disclosed on every page that
      uses such links. You can read the full details on our
      <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'disclosure/'}>affiliate disclosure</a> page.
    </p>

    <h2>Your privacy</h2>
    <p>
      We collect minimal, anonymized analytics to understand what's helpful. Full
      details are in our <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'privacy/'}>privacy policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      Have a book suggestion, a correction, or a partnership idea? Reach us through
      the <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'contact/'}>contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-top: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .about-title {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .about h2 {
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }
  .about p, .about ul {
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .about ul {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
</style>
